      {
        "key": "Trading/Dialog/PlayerTaxi/Lighthouse/p2/Description",
        "source": "I'll stop at the first facility, gotcha. You brought the money, right?",
        "translation": "첫 번째 시설에서 세워주면 되는 거지. 돈은 가져왔고?"
      },
      {
        "key": "Trading/Dialog/PlayerTaxi/Lighthouse/p2/Name",
